  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A ball traveling with a horizontal speed of 20 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> hits a vertical wall and rebounds with a speed of 10 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>. The graph shows how the force exerted by the wall on the ball varies with time.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the mass of the ball?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">2.0 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">4.0 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">6.0 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-2}\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">1.2 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> kg</li>\n</ol>"
